OL,3,GNEWSAAuthor leads region's tributes to
OL,4,ADolly Parton
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlam rock legend Noddy Holder's wife,
OL,7,Fwho wrote a novel about a Dolly Parton
OL,8,Ftribute act, says she has "never met a
OL,9,Fsingle person who doesn't adore" the
OL,10,Flegendary country artist.
OL,12,FThe singer, actress and philanthropist,
OL,13,Fwho has died at the age of 80, was
OL,14,Fknown as the Queen of Country.
OL,16,FSuzan Holder, who was born in Halesowen
OL,17,Fin the West Midlands, said people would
OL,18,Fcall Parton a dumb blonde, but "you
OL,19,Funderestimate Dolly Parton at your
OL,20,Fperil".
