OL,3,GNEWSAAuthor leads region's tributes to
OL,4,ADolly Parton
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Dolly Parton's ethos was 'never dim
OL,7,Fyour light to make somebody else feel
OL,8,Fbetter, shine as brightly as you want
OL,9,Fto', and I just think that's just a
OL,10,Fbeautiful message."
